      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salter_Path%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1923, Alice Hoffman sued residents over cows, but a court decision let them stay while prohibiting grazing on her estate.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
