      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salter_Path%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1979 settlement finally allowed Salter Path residents to hold property titles and enabled Carteret County to tax the former squatter village.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
